meta {
 name: Update Application Showcase
 type: http
}
patch {
 url: {{Host}}/api/Coder/applications/showcase
 body: json
 auth: bearer
}
auth:bearer {
 token: {{AccessToken}}
}
body:json {
 {"kind":"badge","id":"{{ApplicationId}}","showcaseItemIds":["{{ShowcaseId}}"],"expectedShowcaseItemIds":[]}
}
docs {
 Own pending application only. Ordered own showcase UUIDs, including hidden items. Empty array removes all links. Stale arrays or decided applications return 409; unrelated or missing projects return 400. Deletes links, never showcase items.
}
